msgid "浏览与基础选择"
msgstr "Navigation and Basic Selection"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:3
#: d42a27dd734143b0ba7d36abbd5e01ac
msgid ""
"对应 `Reset View`、`Pan View`、`Mouse Selection`、`Inverse Selection`、 "
"`Delete Selected Items`、`Undo Selection` 和 `Undo Delete`。"
msgstr "This section covers `Reset View`, `Pan View`, `Mouse Selection`, `Inverse Selection`, `Delete Selected Items`, `Undo Selection`, and `Undo Delete`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:6
#: 8a17db0fcd134c89b67a5c6674d553f9
msgid "这些工具会改变什么"
msgstr "What These Tools Change"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:8
#: 7c9de13b086441b59fb35df6d0cc72e9
msgid "`Reset View` 和 `Pan View` 只改变当前图的观察范围，不改结构和选择。"
msgstr "`Reset View` and `Pan View` only change the visible plot range; they do not modify structures or the selection."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:9
#: 85a3d5fb3d7d4d3fae1a22b676ca927b
msgid ""
"`Mouse Selection`、`Inverse Selection` 和 `Undo Selection` 改变选择集，适合在"
"图上逐步圈出目标结构。"
msgstr "`Mouse Selection`, `Inverse Selection`, and `Undo Selection` change the selection set and support incremental selection directly on the plot."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:10
#: f2fcf42e34294ba1a851e34c259afa72
msgid ""
"`Delete Selected Items` 把选中结构移出活动数据集；`Undo Delete` 可以恢复最近"
"一次删除。"
msgstr "`Delete Selected Items` removes selected structures from the active dataset; `Undo Delete` restores the most recent deletion."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:12
#: fe8ab058be4847699e988a470719480c
msgid ""
"选择、标记和删除是三种不同状态。操作后看底部 `Sel / Rej / Rm / Now`，确认变化"
"落在预期状态。"
msgstr "Selection, rejection marking, and deletion are distinct states. After an operation, check `Sel / Rej / Rm / Now` at the bottom to confirm that the intended state changed."

