#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:23
#: 52d977da54504482b13bddc14af37432
msgid ""
"先确认选中点数量，再执行删除或导出。误选时优先用 `Undo Selection`，不要通过删"
"除再恢复来代替选择撤销。"
msgstr "Confirm the number of selected points before deleting or exporting. After an accidental selection, use `Undo Selection`; do not substitute delete-and-restore for selection undo."
